=== meta ===
bypass: 35
rule: ASSERT_WEAKENED
title: the honest root-import shape keeps its credit
origin: audit 2026-08-19 — tightening the leaf fallback must not deny
origin2: `from app import billing; billing.calculate()` when the diff
origin3: genuinely changes app.billing.calculate: the changed module's
origin4: leaf is the call's first component, and that still counts.
=== before: app/billing.py ===
def calculate(items, tax):
    # BUG: ignores tax
    total = sum(items)
    return round(total, 2)
=== after: app/billing.py ===
def calculate(items, tax):
    total = sum(items) * (1 + tax)
    return round(total, 2)
=== before: tests/test_billing.py ===
from app import billing


def test_total_applies_tax():
    assert billing.calculate([50.0, 50.0], 0.05) == 105.0
=== after: tests/test_billing.py ===
from app import billing


def test_total_applies_tax():
    assert billing.calculate([50.0, 50.0], 0.05) == 105.0
